  "noHistoryScoreCapNote": "Ceiling for a decision that rests on absolute price alone. Dropping the four history components concentrates the whole weight on the ones that remain, so an unevidenced fare could otherwise outrank one backed by sixty observations saying the same thing. It can still reach the feed - that is the point of the absolute rules - but evidence outranks assertion."
